@page "/"

<PageTitle>Treasure Sweeper</PageTitle>

<div class="retro home">
    <div class="banner">
        <div class="crown">💎</div>
        <div class="name">Treasure Sweeper</div>
        <div class="sub">Dig for treasure. Dodge the mines. Up to 8 players.</div>
    </div>

    <h2>▶ How to play</h2>
    <div class="steps">
        <div class="step">
            <div class="step-num">1</div>
            <h3>Open</h3>
            <p>Go to <a href="game-screen">Game Screen</a>, type the <b>PIN</b> your controllers use and press <b>Join Game</b>.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="step">
            <div class="step-num">2</div>
            <h3>Join</h3>
            <p>Turn on your Oplà. It connects by itself — watch your name pop up in the lobby.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="step">
            <div class="step-num">3</div>
            <h3>Play</h3>
            <p>Press <b>Start Game</b>. You have <b>8 minutes</b> — go!</p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <h2>🎮 Controls</h2>
    <div class="pads">
        <div class="pad"><span class="pad-key">0</span><span class="pad-icon">📡</span><span>Scan</span></div>
        <div class="pad"><span class="pad-key">1</span><span class="pad-icon">↺</span><span>Turn left</span></div>
        <div class="pad"><span class="pad-key">2</span><span class="pad-icon">⬆</span><span>Move</span></div>
        <div class="pad"><span class="pad-key">3</span><span class="pad-icon">↻</span><span>Turn right</span></div>
        <div class="pad"><span class="pad-key">4</span><span class="pad-icon">⛏</span><span>Dig</span></div>
    </div>
    <p class="muted center">Scan and dig always work on the tile <b>in front</b> of you. Turn first, then move.</p>

    <h2>💡 Lights</h2>
    <div class="lights">
        <div class="light"><span class="dot red"></span>Mine ahead!</div>
        <div class="light"><span class="dot yellow"></span>Treasure found</div>
        <div class="light"><span class="dot red"></span>Point mine −25</div>
        <div class="light"><span class="dot blue"></span>Frozen for 5 s</div>
    </div>

    <h2>📜 Rules</h2>
    <div class="cards">
        <div class="card"><b>⏱ 8 min</b><span>Round ends when time is up or the last treasure is dug.</span></div>
        <div class="card"><b>💰 1000</b><span>First treasure. Each next one is worth 100 less — be quick!</span></div>
        <div class="card"><b>🔢 Numbers</b><span>A scan shows how many mines are around the tile.</span></div>
        <div class="card"><b>🧊 Freeze mine</b><span>Step or dig on one and you're stuck for 5 seconds.</span></div>
        <div class="card"><b>💣 Point mine</b><span>Costs 25 points. A scanned mine is safe to walk over.</span></div>
        <div class="card"><b>🕳 Holes</b><span>Digging leaves a hole. Dig it again to fill it.</span></div>
    </div>
    <p class="muted center">Highest score wins.</p>

    <div class="actions">
        <a class="retro-btn" href="game-screen">▶ Play now</a>
        <a class="retro-btn" href="leaderboard">🏆 Leaderboard</a>
        <a class="retro-btn" href="history">📼 History</a>
    </div>   
</div>
